            <ArticleTitle>Phase II trial of pirfenidone in adults with neurofibromatosis type 1.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1860-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We performed an open-label phase II trial of oral pirfenidone in 24 patients with neurofibromatosis type 1 (NF1). Tumors were monitored by three-dimensional MRI. At the end of treatment, four patients had a decrease in tumor volume by 15% or more, three had tumor progression, and 17 remained stable. Pirfenidone warrants further investigation in NF1, which has until now lacked an effective control therapy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
